;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Privacy&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Cookies&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OGL&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;All content is available under the Open Government Licence v3.0 except where otherwise stated.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;#169; Crown copyright" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f2f1;strokeColor=#f3f2f1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0b0c0c;spacingLeft=40;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="618" width="1100" height="78" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p1-note-102" value="Open decisions on this screen&amp;#10;&amp;#10;D-AP-01  Flow ID is a new column with no source values. FLW-0001 onwards are placeholders.&amp;#10;D-AP-02  From Env &amp;#8594; To Env is new. Confirm the valid hops and whether an environment can be skipped.&amp;#10;D-AP-03  Requested By user names are placeholders. The source screen shows a system address on every row.&amp;#10;D-AP-07  The Name column is dropped. Confirm Flow ID alone distinguishes two pending requests.&amp;#10;D-AP-08  Status values on individual rows are placeholders. Confirm whether the grid shows all statuses or only pending ones.&amp;#10;D-AP-09  The built screen renders the heading as Enviornment. Corrected here.&amp;#10;D-AP-04  The lower navigation strip in the source is not reproduced here.&amp;#10;D-AP-05  The live screen reads file transfer requesd. Corrected to requests in this mockup." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7bf;strokeColor=#f47738;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0b0c0c;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="724" width="1020" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="ftr-p2" name="Transfer Catalog"><mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="800" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeig